# Optional. Copy this file to .env.local (or add the variable in your host's
# settings) and set a long random value (32+ characters), for example:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64url'))"
#
# It signs the game sessions. Without it each build makes its own secret, which
# works everywhere but ends open game sessions whenever you deploy a new build.
GAME_SECRET=
